TRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["根据用户输入的文本要求，制作（6）张详细的(亚马逊)（场景图）设计，每段设计写成一段详细的文本提示词，输出的文本段落之间要紧挨着不要有空行\n以下是用户的文本要求：\n背景要干净简洁。\n重点突出女装产品卖点。\n设计适配美国客户的场景。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [397.8986511230469, 135.13943481445312], "pos": [5081.35009765625, -968.3198852539062], "id": 181, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [280], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["爆款销量的设计，并在场景图右上角位置添加4-6个英文单词的卖点词。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [404.2376403808594, 134.74017333984375], "pos": [5076.48486328125, -721.4228515625], "id": 183, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [275], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["2b04a405374bb91ef8746ec81009e08cfbec203b15d1eddcb96e5d21efcc61db.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [458.26922607421875, 554.5582885742188], "pos": [5180.86865234375, -1857.7418212890625], "id": 178, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n1. 1:1（正方形）\n典型用途：头像、NFT、Instagram 帖子、AI 默认输出\n常用尺寸（宽度 = 高度）：\n512×512 — Stable Diffusion 原生默认分辨率\n768×768 — 高清细节生成（需更高显存）\n1024×1024 — Midjourney v5/v6 默认、高质量输出\n2048×2048 — 超高分辨率打印或放大使用\n✅ 推荐生成起点：1024×1024\n\n2. 16:9（宽屏）\n典型用途：横屏视频封面、桌面壁纸、YouTube 缩略图、演示背景\n常用尺寸（宽 : 高 = 16 : 9）：\n1024×576（≈1K，低显存友好）\n1280×720（HD 标准）\n1920×1080（Full HD，最通用）\n2560×1440（2K/QHD，高细节）\n3840×2160（4K UHD，高端输出）\n✅ 推荐生成起点：1920×1080 或 1024×576（若用于 AI 快速生成）\n\n3. 4:3（标准比例）\n典型用途：iPad 屏幕、PPT 幻灯片、老式显示器、教育素材\n常用尺寸（宽 : 高 = 4 : 3）：\n1024×768（经典 XGA）\n1280×960\n1600×1200（UXGA，高分辨率）\n2048×1536（Retina iPad 分辨率）\n✅ 推荐生成起点：1024×768 或 1280×960\n\n4. 3:2（摄影比例）\n典型用途：单反/微单照片、打印照片（如 6×4 英寸）、杂志排版\n常用尺寸（宽 : 高 = 3 : 2）：\n1500×1000\n1800×1200\n2400×1600\n3000×2000（高质量摄影级输出）\n4500×3000（大幅面打印）\n✅ 推荐生成起点：1500×1000 或 2400×1600\n\n5. 2:1（超宽横幅）\n典型用途：横幅广告、全景图、社交媒体封面、UI 背景\n常用尺寸（宽 : 高 = 2 : 1）：\n1024×512（轻量级 AI 生成）\n1920×960（接近双倍 16:9 高度）\n2048×1024（整数倍，适合纹理/贴图）\n3840×1920（4K 级超宽图）\n✅ 推荐生成起点：2048×1024（平衡细节与效率）\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [734, 600.2222290039062], "pos": [3947.132568359375, -2074.833251953125], "id": 160, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-2473.674704859008, 3254.6023086981895], "scale": 0.1948717100000003}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 150, "flags": {}, "id": 9, "title": "图生图亚马逊产品图场景图", "bounding": [5050.00830078125, -2260.431396484375, 4527.4423828125, 2188.310791015625]}], "links": [[257, 170, 0, 166, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [258, 175, 1, 168, 0, "INT"], [259, 175, 2, 168, 1, "INT"], [260, 172, 0, 169, 0, "LATENT"], [261, 165, 0, 169, 1, "VAE"], [262, 1